    skos:broader division:BT ;
    skos:definition "Tiglian Substage A is an Early Pleistocene substage in the NW European Quaternary climatostratigraphic scheme. It is the first of three substages within the Tiglian Stage. It is succeeded by Tiglian Substage B. It is contemporaneous with the Ludhamian Stage in Great Britain (BGS Research Report RR/10/003, table 1b)."@en ;
