    skos:definition "Bashkirian Age is a division of geological time within the Carboniferous Period. It is the only age within the Early Pennsylvanian Epoch. It is preceded by the Serpukhovian Age (Late Mississippian Epoch) and succeeded by the Moscovian Age (Mid Pennsylvanian Epoch) (Geologic Time Scale 2020, figs. 2.1, 23.1; https://timescalefoundation.org/)."@en ;
