    skos:definition "Pridoli Epoch is the last of the four epochs of the Silurian Period. It is preceded by the Ludlow Epoch and succeeded by the Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (Geologic Time Scale 2020, figs. 2.1, 21.1; https://timescalefoundation.org/)."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/ics/ischart/Pridoli> ,
